WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
So all of my dogs and the dogs that come through

2
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.173
my rescue, Pup Culture Rescue,

3
00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.570
have a little quirk.

4
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:08.540
I call it a quirk.

5
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.720
It's not an issue, you know.

6
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.950
It's not something to be judgmental about.

7
00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.040
You just keep it in the back of your mind

8
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.200
that maybe they're a little shy or they don't like feet.

9
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.700
My other dog, he hates feet.

10
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.960
Like, if you just stretch out, it's like he saw a ghost.

11
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.010
So he was probably, unfortunately kicked or something

12
00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:28.860
before I adopted him.

13
00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:32.600
It's amazing how they can be so forgiving of humans

14
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.000
after some human out there has put them through such trauma.

15
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.670
So, what is a good way to foster a dog?

16
00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.930
I would say go straight to your organization.

17
00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.690
But beyond that, what your advice?

18
00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:45.900
Totally.

19
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.870 line:15%
It's a great way to meet people

20
00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:50.070 line:15%
and the community is so amazing.

21
00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:53.480 line:15%
Check out Petfinder, Adoptapet.com.

22
00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.340 line:15%
Social media is amazing.

23
00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:57.570
Just search for your local rescue.

24
00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.930
We need fosters so badly,

25
00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:01.020
because without fosters

26
00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:05.210
we can't pull more dogs off the streets or out of shelters.

27
00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.940
So, if you have a little extra time

28
00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.460
and you can open your home up,

29
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.817 line:15%
it is an excellent way to give back.

30
00:01:11.817 --> 00:01:14.400
(upbeat music)

